# OpenEvolve spike-specific runtime outputs — regenerable from
# initial_program.py + evaluator.py + config.yaml. Contains per-iter
# generated candidates, MAP-Elites checkpoints, openevolve's internal
# plotly visualisations.
#
# Sweep aggregates land directly in
# experiments/milestones/pokemon_progression.yaml — the canonical
# bar chart (experiments/progress/pokemon_stage_progression.png)
# shows means + std error bars per sweep via
# autoresearch.compare.plot_milestone_bars.
